1768 0 obj
<<
/Title (IPv6 privacy extensions allow IoT devices to rotate temporary addresses, reducing address-based tracking but complicating local security monitoring. Priv6Guard proposes a privacy-aware monitoring system that correlates security events through authenticated, short-lived local sessions and pseudonyms rather than permanent device identifiers. The system monitors IPv6 traffic, detects suspicious Router Advertisements and abnormal Neighbor Discovery Protocol \(NDP\) activity, and presents alerts through a web dashboard. A controlled five-device IPv6 LAN will be used to evaluate detection performance, session continuity, pseudonym expiration, and cross-tenant isolation.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1150 0 R
>>
endobj
